        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Area Fire</p>\n<p><strong>Critical</strong> @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1}</p><hr /><p>This grenade resembles a large coin that rapidly spins when used. When it explodes, the grenade creates an area of antimagic for 1 minute. Creatures in the @Template[burst|distance:25] when the grenade detonates must attempt a @Check[fortitude|against:class] save. Creatures that fail their save have difficulty casting spells for the next minute: during that time, 1- and 2-action spells require an additional action to cast. If you have the critical weapon specialization of grenades, creatures that critically fail their save are additionally @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 minute.</p>"
